  "details": "Hi, I am taking a lot of pictures around in VRchat as well as some of my friends. I appreciate that VRchat added features such as drone mod (that I never use) and resolution change directly in the camera.\nBUT, the reorganized buttons is really problematic as some features like focus are hidden in the middle and I heard a lot of players thinking the feature is gone on not knowing it exist at all. Also, it is now hard or impossible to scroll through the options and sometimes manipulating zoom and camera is a bit complicated. All of that is since the new camera version that I was excited for but now I really regret it as it is more a pain to take pictures.\nConcerning Focus, that it is Auto Focus, Semi-Auto or Manual, it isn’t working properly at all anymore. For exemple using Auto Focus, it only works when you keep default focus point in the center (90% of the time) but as soon as you want to select manually a focus point or use other mods of the camera, the focus simply doesn’t work. With the previous version, I could select anywhere on an object or a person and focus was done, now the camera just doesn’t understand and stay blurry. \nThis is all since last beta with Menu 2.0 (that I really like) but since it is live now, I thought it would be corrected but no.\nHopping we can have a working as before and more UI friendly camera in the future as it became more complicated and annoying to take pictures than anything. Especially for new or inexperienced players.",
